WEBVTT

00:00.480 --> 00:02.980
DAY 71

00:12.490 --> 00:17.500
The human troops have finally begun
their attack on Kudel Greatwoods.

00:18.210 --> 00:21.040
However, if you would turn
your back against our enemy,

00:21.040 --> 00:23.250
we will cancel our agreement immediately.

00:23.250 --> 00:25.920
Thank you for the warning.
We accept those terms.

00:25.920 --> 00:29.260
But you are to let us operate freely.

00:29.260 --> 00:34.760
And so, we began our first work
as a mercenary group, Para Bellum!

00:34.760 --> 00:37.020
We brought 36 members...

00:37.020 --> 00:38.770
...and with Spellsei's ability,

00:38.770 --> 00:42.110
we also brought along our familiars...

00:42.110 --> 00:43.770
And with our 73 strong,

00:44.200 --> 00:46.590
we started to move
in the early morning.

02:23.040 --> 02:25.920
The reason why we moved at such time...

02:25.920 --> 02:29.170
...is because one of my partitions
that I sent out...

02:29.170 --> 02:32.760
...scouted a human troops encampment.

02:36.510 --> 02:38.430
This magical barrier is the type of magic...

02:38.430 --> 02:41.270
...that block any monster
other than the original caster.

02:42.100 --> 02:44.270
We better destroy it soon.

02:44.750 --> 02:47.020
Surround the barrier.

02:48.060 --> 02:51.030
While making sure everyone
was in position,

02:51.030 --> 02:55.780
I first strengthened Gáe Derg
using my Attribute Echo,

02:57.570 --> 03:00.030
and destroyed the barrier.

03:09.460 --> 03:10.590
What happened?

03:20.030 --> 03:21.600
Then for the remaining soldier...

03:22.220 --> 03:24.480
Dhami and Spellsei...

03:24.480 --> 03:26.940
...cast barrage attack magic.

03:27.850 --> 03:31.730
While they were at it,
I spawned my army of Skeleton.

03:31.730 --> 03:35.860
I spammed my spear attacks
and took out large numbers of the army.

03:39.370 --> 03:43.540
But the human troops weren't
just planning on giving up.

03:53.250 --> 03:57.130
I see, that female knight
is their commander.

03:57.130 --> 03:59.760
Let's give her a proper welcome.

04:09.020 --> 04:11.270
The one who's controlling
the Undead Legion...

04:11.270 --> 04:13.690
...is that Dark Ogre!

04:13.690 --> 04:15.610
Focus your attack on him
and take him down!

04:15.610 --> 04:17.280
Ma'am!

04:22.030 --> 04:22.870
Now!

04:30.880 --> 04:33.000
Agility buff, huh?

04:33.630 --> 04:38.340
Her situational awareness
and decision-making skills are not bad...

04:38.340 --> 04:40.970
Also, aiming for my heart
is a very good choice.

04:48.310 --> 04:49.730
Commander!

04:51.330 --> 04:55.730
Alright, you can make a good addition.
I'll spare you and take you alive.

04:56.070 --> 05:00.240
Don't you dare speak, lowly Ogre!
I will take that life of yours!

05:00.240 --> 05:02.620
Oh, I like that spirit!

05:02.620 --> 05:05.740
You're a better woman
than I thought you would be!

05:05.740 --> 05:07.220
Silence.

05:07.220 --> 05:10.250
If you want to take me on,
do your worst.

05:10.250 --> 05:14.250
If you can defeat me, you're welcome
to take what you will!

05:15.380 --> 05:16.500
Oh really?

05:17.460 --> 05:20.090
The knightess, the mage,
and the priestess.

05:20.090 --> 05:22.930
And that one female swordswoman
with Flame Sword.

05:22.930 --> 05:26.010
Let's capture them alive.

05:26.310 --> 05:29.770
You may kill or eat the others.

05:29.770 --> 05:32.400
If you don't want to lose,
give it your all!

05:32.980 --> 05:35.770
What transpired
in the following minutes...

05:36.140 --> 05:37.820
...was less fighting,

05:37.820 --> 05:40.780
and more lopsided.

05:48.410 --> 05:50.080
Please leave it to me, Madam Dhami!

05:50.080 --> 05:53.250
I will kill them all for you!

05:53.250 --> 05:57.340
As long as I breathe,
I will submit to Madam Dhami's will!

05:57.340 --> 06:01.840
This is the first time I use this,
but Bewitching Evil Eye sure is scary...

06:07.100 --> 06:11.600
Everyone, please put more
energy into your fright, okay?

06:11.600 --> 06:14.020
What are those?

06:14.020 --> 06:15.860
The blood from the dead is morphing!

06:16.610 --> 06:19.440
Bloodsato seems like having fun!

06:19.440 --> 06:21.360
I'll not lose either!

06:23.780 --> 06:29.200
As a result, we're able to defeat
the entire army without a single loss...

06:30.560 --> 06:32.960
But this Knightess' sword...

06:33.580 --> 06:35.710
...was able to touch me once.

06:36.610 --> 06:39.380
It's a wound that can heal instantly,

06:39.380 --> 06:41.380
but she was able to fight this far.

06:41.380 --> 06:43.720
I sincerely think it was impressive.

06:47.720 --> 06:50.720
Please, run, hurry!

06:51.470 --> 06:55.230
That dragon...
Weiss Flamen Dragon.

06:55.940 --> 07:01.230
I don't think even Ogrou can stand
that kind of spell.

07:01.230 --> 07:05.990
I'm sure she's prepared
to take Ogrou out with her.

07:05.990 --> 07:09.080
I can't hold much longer.

07:09.080 --> 07:10.830
Please forgive me...

07:16.750 --> 07:19.630
Sorry, but I won.

07:20.090 --> 07:22.590
I have no intention of
letting you die here.

07:29.390 --> 07:31.310
I see.

07:31.310 --> 07:35.480
A magical shield created
by a third-tier Demise spell...

07:35.480 --> 07:38.350
A vacuum shield created with
Aero Master skill...

07:38.350 --> 07:41.360
....and a high-pressure water shield
created with Hydro Hand,

07:41.360 --> 07:45.360
lining up the three then firing it
at high speed with Back Attack.

07:45.700 --> 07:47.780
You can neutralize
the dragon with that.

07:48.360 --> 07:50.110
Although it's a messy technique.

07:55.370 --> 07:58.500
And so the battle ended
with a blowout victory.

07:59.330 --> 08:00.130
But...

08:00.630 --> 08:04.310
It's a big accomplishment to be able
to capture such highly skilled people.

08:05.760 --> 08:08.380
O-Outrageous...

08:09.470 --> 08:12.430
We did say we won't kill them.

08:12.430 --> 08:14.890
So we will work them hard.

08:14.890 --> 08:17.890
Okay everyone! Let's head back!

08:18.140 --> 08:20.020
ABILITY "BRAVE HEART" LEARNED
Brave Heart, Sweep, Militia Control,

08:20.020 --> 08:20.520
ABILITY "SWEEP" LEARNED
Quick reading, Commander, Heavy Sword,

08:20.520 --> 08:20.980
ABILITY "MILITIA CONTROL" LEARNED
Quick reading, Commander, Heavy Sword,

08:20.980 --> 08:21.400
ABILITY "QUICK READING" LEARNED
Quick reading, Commander, Heavy Sword,

08:21.400 --> 08:21.900
JOB "COMMANDER" LEARNED
Minstrel, Strategist, Lancer, Slave, Farmer,

08:21.900 --> 08:22.270
JOB "HEAVY SWORD" LEARNED
Minstrel, Strategist, Lancer, Slave, Farmer,

08:22.270 --> 08:22.770
JOB "MINSTREL" LEARNED
Minstrel, Strategist, Lancer, Slave, Farmer,

08:22.770 --> 08:23.190
ABILITY "SMITHING" LEARNED
Minstrel, Strategist, Lancer, Slave, Farmer,

08:23.190 --> 08:23.650
ABILITY "EVASION UP" LEARNED
Minstrel, Strategist, Lancer, Slave, Farmer,

08:23.650 --> 08:24.110
JOB "STRATEGIST" LEARNED
Monk, Heavy Warrior, Light Warrior,

08:24.110 --> 08:24.610
JOB "LANCER" LEARNED
Monk, Heavy Warrior, Light Warrior,

08:24.610 --> 08:25.110
JOB "SLAVE" LEARNED
Monk, Heavy Warrior, Light Warrior,

08:25.110 --> 08:25.480
JOB "MONK" LEARNED
Monk, Heavy Warrior, Light Warrior,

08:25.480 --> 08:25.940
JOB "FARMER" LEARNED
Wheel Slash, Cross Slash,

08:25.940 --> 08:26.440
JOB "HEAVY WARRIOR" LEARNED
Wheel Slash, Cross Slash,

08:26.440 --> 08:26.900
JOB "LIGHT WARRIOR" LEARNED
Wheel Slash, Cross Slash,

08:26.900 --> 08:27.400
ABILITY "WHEEL SLASH" LEARNED
Stiffen Breathing, Light Breathing,

08:27.400 --> 08:27.780
ABILITY "CROSS SLASH" LEARNED
Stiffen Breathing, Light Breathing,

08:27.780 --> 08:28.320
ABILITY "STIFFEN BREATHING" LEARNED
Stiffen Breathing, Light Breathing,

08:28.320 --> 08:28.740
ABILITY "LIGHT BREATHING" LEARNED
One-Sided Justice, Unwavering Faith,

08:28.740 --> 08:29.240
ABILITY "ONE-SIDED JUSTICE" LEARNED
One-Sided Justice, Unwavering Faith,

08:29.240 --> 08:29.660
ABILITY "UNWAVERING FAITH " LEARNED
One-Sided Justice, Unwavering Faith,

08:29.660 --> 08:30.200
ABILITY "FOOLISH BELIEF" LEARNED
Foolish Belief, Chain Soul.

08:30.200 --> 08:30.610
ABILITY "CHAIN SOUL" LEARNED
Foolish Belief, Chain Soul.

08:31.160 --> 08:31.940
Hey.

08:32.780 --> 08:35.790
Your footwork is extremely light
for an old man.

08:38.460 --> 08:43.630
Thanks to you,
the advance has been halted.

08:43.630 --> 08:46.800
Since we were late to show up,
we brought alcohol to celebrate.

08:47.510 --> 08:50.300
I'm glad with this,
so I don't protest.

08:54.180 --> 08:57.810
I went to see how are
our prisoners doing.

08:58.350 --> 09:02.650
But apparently, as humans are more easily
influenced by natural urges than elves,

09:02.650 --> 09:05.320
my medicine worked in no time.

09:05.900 --> 09:09.450
Stop! I'm a woman of high standing!

09:09.450 --> 09:12.450
As if I can do cross-breeding!

09:12.450 --> 09:16.240
- But I'm an ogre, so it doesn't matter.
- Stop! Don't come any further!

09:16.240 --> 09:18.330
Hey! Stop! No!

09:19.460 --> 09:23.000
- Slow dooooooowwn!!!!
- Today there were many screams...

09:23.000 --> 09:25.460
One way or another.

09:25.960 --> 09:28.460
DAY 72

09:29.380 --> 09:30.970
The effect of the earcuff...

09:30.970 --> 09:33.220
is that you can't lie
or hide anything.

09:33.220 --> 09:35.910
So we're able to secure a lot
of information.

09:35.910 --> 09:37.720
It's not just for us,

09:37.720 --> 09:40.230
but for the elder elf as well.

09:40.660 --> 09:42.100
That being said,

09:42.100 --> 09:44.730
We can't rely on your
strength all the time.

09:45.230 --> 09:48.570
This is originally our problem,
that's why.

09:48.570 --> 09:52.490
Therefore, I would like to buy any
information you got from the POWs.

09:52.490 --> 09:54.740
We need to fight,
so we can use that advantage.

09:55.320 --> 09:57.490
Of course I will reward you.

09:59.040 --> 10:01.120
How about ten more barrels
of this alcohol?

10:01.120 --> 10:05.500
Man! That's some good
negotiation skills!

10:05.500 --> 10:08.210
Well, you can't argue
with good alcohol.

10:08.210 --> 10:11.010
I passed all the information to the elder.

10:11.550 --> 10:16.890
Yahalo? I found the hidden
route of the human troops.

10:16.890 --> 10:18.760
They will ambush you next.

10:19.470 --> 10:22.060
Apparently, the humans are
planning to use their numbers

10:22.060 --> 10:24.900
to suppress the elves
from different directions.

10:24.900 --> 10:27.630
Dispersing troops is not ideal,

10:27.630 --> 10:30.260
but considering the narrow passage
of Kudel Greatwoods,

10:30.260 --> 10:32.530
they don't have many options.

10:33.030 --> 10:35.570
His ability is as good
as the rumors say.

10:35.570 --> 10:36.620
Dear Father.

10:36.620 --> 10:39.430
What kind of spell is "Yahalo?"

10:40.540 --> 10:43.040
DAY 73

10:43.430 --> 10:47.670
This time, we went around
their designated routes,

10:47.670 --> 10:52.550
laid out a bunch of traps,
and waited in the trench.

10:55.800 --> 10:58.970
The troops were led
by fully armored knights.

10:58.970 --> 11:03.560
Their numbers were around 500.

11:03.560 --> 11:08.560
Along with the heavy infantry,
there were also 100 wizards.

11:08.560 --> 11:12.610
If those elves were about to fight them
head-on, it would be a long, hard battle.

11:12.610 --> 11:14.070
But...

11:14.070 --> 11:17.570
For a fully prepared army like us,
this was but a target practice.

11:25.620 --> 11:26.710
The road's blocked!

11:30.500 --> 11:36.010
Boulders buffed with Enhancement
quickly thinned their ranks.

11:36.010 --> 11:39.620
The 500 numbers went down
to 300 in an instant.

11:41.260 --> 11:46.100
Then, from Long-range Squad,
a rain of crossbow with Periglet.

11:47.390 --> 11:48.980
Even if they can evade that,

11:48.980 --> 11:52.650
there are goblins around
waiting for them to fall into pit traps.

11:53.190 --> 11:56.780
With this, the numbers went down
to less than 100, but...

11:57.910 --> 12:01.280
Men! Those who are still alive,
gather and form a wall!

12:04.150 --> 12:07.790
Use anything you can find!
Shields or bodies! Build a wall!

12:07.790 --> 12:11.790
Wow... That commanding knight
isn't half bad...

12:17.800 --> 12:21.800
The situation was at a stalemate,
so we tried to change our strategy.

12:22.110 --> 12:26.310
Ogrekichi, rush there and try
to take that commander alive.

12:26.690 --> 12:27.560
Okay!

12:29.130 --> 12:32.820
Here they come! Shoot!
Don't let them get close!

12:36.780 --> 12:42.070
We had three to take on each enemy
to ensure they were dead.

12:42.070 --> 12:46.450
Now, let's see if Ogrekichi
can hold back.

12:50.080 --> 12:51.130
Dammit!

12:52.500 --> 12:55.090
Everything about you is crazy, huh?

12:55.460 --> 12:57.340
What are you smiling about?

13:05.160 --> 13:08.270
Even though he had the handicap of
being captured alive by his enemy,

13:08.270 --> 13:13.690
he fought well even for a lone wolf.
Now this is worthy of something.

13:19.700 --> 13:23.200
It's over, Ogrou! It was fun!

13:23.670 --> 13:25.230
Well done!

13:26.580 --> 13:28.700
Today's also a good fight!

13:28.700 --> 13:33.540
Just like before, we reported
to the elder elf and withdrew.

13:33.790 --> 13:35.880
JOB "SORCERER" LEARNED
Sorcerer, Shielder, Sentinel, Archer,

13:35.880 --> 13:36.380
JOB "SHIELDER" LEARNED
Sorcerer, Shielder, Sentinel, Archer,

13:36.380 --> 13:36.920
JOB "SENTINEL" LEARNED
Hunter, Item Creator, Shield Bash,

13:36.920 --> 13:37.380
JOB "ARCHER" LEARNED
Hunter, Item Creator, Shield Bash,

13:37.380 --> 13:37.920
JOB "HUNTER" LEARNED
Hunter, Item Creator, Shield Bash,

13:37.920 --> 13:38.510
JOB "ITEM CREATOR" LEARNED
Strategy Growth, Knowledge of the Sword,

13:38.510 --> 13:38.920
ABILITY “SHIELD BASH” LEARNED
Strategy Growth, Knowledge of the Sword,

13:38.920 --> 13:39.380
ABILITY “STRATEGY GROWTH” LEARNED
Strategy Growth, Knowledge of the Sword,

13:39.380 --> 13:39.920
ABILITY “KNOWLEDGE OF THE SWORD” LEARNED
Knowledge of Defense, Shield Wall,

13:39.920 --> 13:40.380
ABILITY “KNOWLEDGE OF DEFENSE” LEARNED
Knowledge of Defense, Shield Wall,

13:40.380 --> 13:40.840
ABILITY “SHIELD WALL” LEARNED
High Analyze.

13:40.840 --> 13:41.380
ABILITY “ALL APPRAISAL MAGIC ITEM” LEARNED
High Analyze.

13:42.720 --> 13:45.600
He kinda reminds me of you.

13:45.600 --> 13:51.100
Oh? But I never understand the excitement of
having your back pushed against the wall.

13:54.350 --> 13:57.230
Um, I was really getting excited...

13:57.820 --> 13:59.860
...during the fighting.

14:01.110 --> 14:04.570
I want to bear your child, Ogrou.

14:05.870 --> 14:09.790
I like women
who are straight on like this!

14:09.790 --> 14:10.620
Hm?

14:11.120 --> 14:13.620
DAY 74

14:14.210 --> 14:17.380
What the heck was that dark ogre?

14:17.710 --> 14:20.670
To be forced into a place
like this while still alive...

14:20.670 --> 14:23.210
It's more humiliating than death!

14:23.210 --> 14:24.740
Shut it...

14:25.750 --> 14:27.430
Calm down a little.

14:27.430 --> 14:30.640
At least there's food and bed here.
Not as bad I say.

14:30.640 --> 14:33.640
You're from a commoner herd,
so you won't understand!

14:33.640 --> 14:36.690
This is a serious matter
that tarnished our nobility status!

14:36.690 --> 14:38.730
Ah, is that so?

14:38.730 --> 14:41.690
Seems like you're still fine,
with all that talk.

14:46.030 --> 14:50.160
Tell me why would humans
invade the land of elves.

14:50.910 --> 14:52.250
The story went like this...

14:53.170 --> 14:55.080
The First Princess of Sternbert Kingdom,

14:55.080 --> 14:58.170
one of the human lands,
suffers from a strange disease...

14:58.170 --> 15:01.650
...that had a 99% mortality rate.

15:02.920 --> 15:08.930
The Princess was scheduled to marry
the next emperor of Kilika Empire.

15:09.510 --> 15:13.430
For that reason,
the King ordered to search for a cure.

15:14.520 --> 15:18.420
Then, as the result of that search,

15:18.420 --> 15:20.160
there was a saying that...

15:20.160 --> 15:22.950
...in this Kudel Greatwoods,
there's an elven secret medicine...

15:22.950 --> 15:25.550
...created under the blessing
of the Demigod of deep green.

15:25.950 --> 15:30.950
In short,
this war was a result of human greed.

15:31.830 --> 15:35.480
Humans really are a bothersome species...

15:36.210 --> 15:40.920
To be fair, I was once a human too,
so I understand.

15:43.460 --> 15:45.470
Hm? What's this?

15:48.340 --> 15:51.220
- What happened, Earthe?
- An intruder?

15:51.640 --> 15:53.220
Dunno!

15:54.270 --> 15:56.730
I heard a big noise just now!

16:02.610 --> 16:03.890
Hot spring?

16:04.670 --> 16:06.820
Thank you for your patience, everyone!

16:07.310 --> 16:11.030
Improves healing ability and promises recovery
from any abnormal status!

16:11.030 --> 16:14.120
Filled with fantasy
and beautifies your skin!

16:14.120 --> 16:18.670
A wonderful facility that promises
the ultimate warmth and relaxation!

16:18.670 --> 16:19.830
And the name is...

16:20.830 --> 16:21.710
Bath!

16:34.390 --> 16:36.100
What's wrong, Kichi?

16:36.440 --> 16:39.100
Your skin is so soft, Dhami.

16:39.940 --> 16:42.110
Sei, yours too.

16:42.110 --> 16:44.820
Bloodsato's also outstanding.

16:44.820 --> 16:46.780
You too, Ms. Blacksmith.

16:46.780 --> 16:49.610
And you two are also remarkable.

16:49.610 --> 16:52.360
Ms. Alchemist too!

16:57.500 --> 16:58.620
What about me?

16:59.290 --> 17:04.130
I should really thank Earthe
for this great deal of a bargain!

17:04.630 --> 17:07.130
DAY 75

17:07.530 --> 17:11.010
The next day, I had a certain thought,

17:11.010 --> 17:14.890
so I brought the human prisoners
and began a new training session.

17:15.560 --> 17:20.600
I want other members
to improve their combat ability,

17:20.600 --> 17:25.400
and one way to do it,
is by using real soldiers as simulation.

17:26.230 --> 17:29.650
Concentrate all archers
to attack on the rear lancer.

17:30.020 --> 17:32.570
Defense soldier,
deploy middle guard!

17:32.570 --> 17:35.660
Those who can give appropriate
instruction to each unit,

17:35.660 --> 17:37.490
will defeat their opponent and win.

17:37.490 --> 17:39.910
I devoted myself to being a referee.

17:40.790 --> 17:42.920
Okay, you're dead! Out!

17:43.540 --> 17:46.420
Both Dhami and Spellsei were strong.

17:47.130 --> 17:50.590
On the contrary, Ogrekichi and Bloodsato
were eliminated quickly.

17:52.470 --> 17:55.220
Kichi, ya fine?

17:55.220 --> 17:58.930
Apparently, this shows the difference
between brainers and non-brainers.

17:59.520 --> 18:04.150
Why do goblins and the like
train in group combat...

18:04.150 --> 18:06.440
What are they planning...

18:12.530 --> 18:15.120
Hey, I'm bored with just bone opponents.

18:15.120 --> 18:18.200
I wanna try to take you on, may I?

18:18.830 --> 18:20.700
You have courage.

18:21.620 --> 18:26.840
While his friends tired out,
this guy's coming straight to me.

18:26.840 --> 18:30.210
This is the courage of the Iron Knight.

18:32.380 --> 18:33.470
This is...

18:33.470 --> 18:38.160
If I don't do this,
you'll be crushed in an instant.

18:46.520 --> 18:50.980
But, if you fight a rare ogre species
like me with your bare fists...

19:03.580 --> 19:06.580
Ogrou! I wanna fight him too!

19:08.590 --> 19:10.800
Apparently, Ogrekichi...

19:10.800 --> 19:14.470
...was also inspired
by this man's spirit.

19:14.470 --> 19:15.840
He's good!

19:16.300 --> 19:19.500
This may be a waste
to treat him as a prisoner...

19:19.500 --> 19:20.850
Amazing...

19:20.850 --> 19:23.640
Oh, then we'll take
Ogrou for ourselves.

19:28.610 --> 19:32.360
Originally, I came from a land
with many demi-humans.

19:32.770 --> 19:36.910
That's why it's easier for me to talk
to you compared to those aristocrats.

19:36.910 --> 19:40.700
In fact, I can't understand
why they hate demi-humans so much.

19:40.700 --> 19:42.370
I see...

19:42.370 --> 19:44.700
Here, please eat a lot!

19:44.700 --> 19:46.420
This place is amazing.

19:46.420 --> 19:50.380
Demi-humans, beastmen,
and humans all live together.

19:51.290 --> 19:54.260
I can tell that you
organize this place well.

19:55.420 --> 19:58.640
Maybe he's sent
by divine intervention itself.

20:00.890 --> 20:03.970
I quit being an Imperial Knight.

20:03.970 --> 20:06.390
I will fight under your banner.

20:06.890 --> 20:11.400
I really have a soft spot
for serious people like this.

20:17.030 --> 20:20.910
The potential of talented people
should be used frequently.

20:22.660 --> 20:25.330
From today's on, he's your master.

20:25.910 --> 20:31.670
Please teach her combat skills
and arts only humans know.

20:35.420 --> 20:37.920
DAY 77

20:38.970 --> 20:41.800
There are still rooms in our base,

20:41.800 --> 20:43.930
but these guys are not strong.

20:44.300 --> 20:47.390
If I keep them over in mine,
they'll just become a hindrance.

20:47.390 --> 20:49.440
I will accept them.

20:49.940 --> 20:55.440
Also, could you tell me about the secret
medicine that these humans are after?

20:55.440 --> 20:58.780
That was what I gave you earlier.

20:58.780 --> 21:00.450
I couldn't explain the details,

21:00.820 --> 21:04.450
but apparently, it's a medicine
that can cure all illnesses.

21:05.120 --> 21:07.450
Why would you give me
something so precious?

21:09.960 --> 21:14.250
What? Our rule is not to
give it to humans.

21:14.250 --> 21:17.840
But it does not forbid giving it
to an ogre who saved my daughter.

21:17.840 --> 21:19.470
That's all.

21:23.470 --> 21:25.600
ABILITY "QUICK REGENERATION" LEARNED
Reanimate, Medicine Blood.

21:25.600 --> 21:26.970
ABILITY "BLOOD OF PANACEA" LEARNED
Reanimate, Medicine Blood.

21:27.400 --> 21:30.910
Medicine Blood? What is that?

21:36.900 --> 21:39.240
W-What is this...

21:39.950 --> 21:42.990
All my wounds and pains are healed!

21:43.840 --> 21:47.490
What is this... this is crazy.

21:47.930 --> 21:50.160
Such effect with just one drip...

21:50.160 --> 21:52.580
What if you drink more than a drop?

21:52.580 --> 21:55.210
Could it be... that I...

21:55.210 --> 21:58.880
I can keep powering up forever?

23:30.010 --> 23:39.980
NEXT EPISODE: RE:SIST
